- `Record<LogLevel, ...>` ensures every level has a matching method, and the union type restricts `level` to valid values.
- The methods are captured at module load time, so binding `console` isn't an issue in browsers; if you need late binding (e.g. for test spies), call `console[level]` directly instead:

